<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Word</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 80), Paladin (guild level 90)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy word &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy word</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A holy word, spoken with a touch, that wounds those who lean to evil. Any 
target whose alignment is below neutral can be struck; the truly evil are 
struck harder still. On the good and the neutral, nothing happens. The 
better your divine power and sphere, the more it hurts.
</p><p>Being a touch, it does most against plate and chain, and a shield can block 
it. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Touch</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Grasp</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Shout</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>